# Turbo
.turbo

# Output
build
dist
# 收编适配: cm-language fork 的 dist 入库（apps/app 的 @codemirror/language
# 指向本 fork，缺 dist 会让 fresh clone 后聚合构建断）；apps/app/dist 照常排除。
!packages/cm-language/dist/
!packages/cm-language/dist/**

# Debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

